1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:16,567
A streamer goes live: one transaction launches a coin on Meteora's Dynamic Bonding Curve.
Solana devnet · signed with the app's local test wallet

2
00:00:16,567 --> 00:00:24,567
First minute: the launch fee falls from 50% to 1%, so snipers don't win.

3
00:00:24,567 --> 00:00:38,767
Viewers buy and sell on the curve. 80% of every fee goes to the streamer.

4
00:00:38,767 --> 00:00:48,933
Every trade lands in Recent trades and on the live ticker tape.

5
00:00:48,933 --> 00:00:57,933
The streamer claims their earnings any time.

6
00:00:57,933 --> 00:01:15,433
The curve fills (0.1 SOL on devnet). Anyone graduates the coin into a Meteora DAMM v2 pool.

7
00:01:15,433 --> 00:01:24,433
Trading goes on, now in the coin's Meteora pool.

8
00:01:24,433 --> 00:01:33,367
The streamer's locked LP keeps earning pool fees. Claim in one click.

9
00:01:33,367 --> 00:01:42,867
The OBS overlay puts the price and graduation bar on stream.

10
00:01:42,867 --> 00:01:53,067
All on Meteora, all on-chain: the graduation tx and the memestream DBC config.

11
00:01:53,067 --> 00:01:59,067
memestream: a coin for every live stream. Built on Meteora DBC.
memestream-iota.vercel.app

